  "hints": [
    "Maintain three collections of sets: rows[9], cols[9], and boxes[9] (or (r // 3, c // 3)).",
    "Ignore cells containing \".\", and for each digit check if it already exists in rows[r], cols[c], or boxes[(r // 3, c // 3)].",
    "Pseudocode:\n  rows, cols, boxes = [set() for _ in range(9)], [set() for _ in range(9)], {}\n  for r in range(9): for c in range(9): check val != \".\" against row, col, (r//3, c//3)"
  ],
